(
 'Report all issues over all repos of a given owner.'
 'By default an HTML report is compiled and the filename returned but check -raw.'
 ''
 '-assignees=  Use this to filter the issues accordingly'
 '-raw         If you don''t want an HTML report but the raw data use this flag'
 '-filename=   By default a temp file is generated. You may specify a specific filename'
 '             instead. If the file already exists it is overwritten.'
 '             Is ignored when -raw is specified.'
)
